{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"Aetherix API","description":"Aetherix F&B Operations Agent backend","version":"0.1.0"},"paths":{"/api/v1/pms/mcp/probe":{"get":{"tags":["pms"],"summary":"Probe Mcp Connection","description":"Synchronous health-check for the Apaleo MCP connection.\n\nValidates:\n1. Required env vars are present (APALEO_CLIENT_ID, APALEO_CLIENT_SECRET,\n   APALEO_MCP_SERVER_URL).\n2. OAuth2 client-credentials token can be acquired.\n3. MCP session can be initialised (streamable-HTTP, list_tools handshake).\n\nReturns a JSON payload with connection status and latency — no DB writes,\nno background tasks, safe to call as a readiness probe.","operationId":"probe_mcp_connection_api_v1_pms_mcp_probe_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object","title":"Response Probe Mcp Connection Api V1 Pms Mcp Probe Get"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/pms/status":{"get":{"tags":["pms"],"summary":"Get Pms Status","description":"Returns the current connection status of the PMS.","operationId":"get_pms_status_api_v1_pms_status_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}},"security":[{"OAuth2PasswordBearer":[]}]}},"/api/v1/pms/sync":{"post":{"tags":["pms"],"summary":"Trigger Pms Sync","description":"Triggers a data sync from the PMS for a specific property and date.\nGuarded by 'get_current_user' to ensure tenant-only access.\n\nAdapter priority: mock > mcp > raw API.","operationId":"trigger_pms_sync_api_v1_pms_sync_post","security":[{"OAuth2PasswordBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"target_date","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","format":"date"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Target Date"}},{"name":"use_mock","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether to use the Mock adapter for pilot verification","default":true,"title":"Use Mock"},"description":"Whether to use the Mock adapter for pilot verification"},{"name":"use_mcp","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","description":"Use Apaleo MCP Server instead of raw REST API (HOS-101)","default":false,"title":"Use Mcp"},"description":"Use Apaleo MCP Server instead of raw REST API (HOS-101)"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/predictions/current":{"get":{"tags":["predictions"],"summary":"Get Property Prediction","description":"Fetches a hybrid prediction (Prophet + RAG) for a property.","operationId":"get_property_prediction_api_v1_predictions_current_get","security":[{"OAuth2PasswordBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"target_date","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","format":"date"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Target Date"}},{"name":"service_type","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","default":"dinner","title":"Service Type"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/predictions/predict":{"post":{"tags":["predictions"],"summary":"Forecast F&B covers (MCP-callable)","description":"MCP-callable endpoint: given a hotel_id and date, returns a structured\ndemand forecast with LLM reasoning (Claude Sonnet) or a heuristic fallback\nwhen ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is absent.\n\nDesigned for agent-to-agent use (HOS-37 / HOS-71 MCP Server). No JWT auth\nrequired — authenticate at the infrastructure layer (API key header, VPN, etc.)\nwhen exposing publicly.\n\nSchema stability: BREAKING changes require a version bump (Agent SEO policy).","operationId":"predict_api_v1_predictions_predict_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PredictRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PredictResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"x-agent-callable":true,"x-mcp-compatible":true}},"/api/v1/predictions/train":{"post":{"tags":["predictions"],"summary":"Train Prophet model — orchestrates MCP adapter → DataTransformer → PredictionEngine (Decision #13)","description":"Orchestrates the full Prophet training pipeline (Decision #13 gap closure).\n\ndata_source=synthetic  → loads demo_data/prophet_training.json (default, no credentials needed)\ndata_source=mcp_sandbox → fetches live Apaleo MCP reservations\ndata_source=hybrid      → merges both sources, each row tagged with 'source' column\n\nAfter training the model is active in-process and persisted for restart-resilience.\nEvery call is audit-logged to the training_runs table.","operationId":"train_prophet_api_v1_predictions_train_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TrainRequest","default":{"property_id":"demo_hotel","start_date":"2025-04-27","end_date":"2026-04-26","data_source":"synthetic","include_weather":true,"include_events":true,"include_occupancy":true}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TrainResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/webhooks/twilio/whatsapp":{"post":{"tags":["webhooks"],"summary":"Twilio Whatsapp Webhook","description":"Inbound webhook for Twilio WhatsApp messages.\nUses BackgroundTasks for non-blocking processing.","operationId":"twilio_whatsapp_webhook_api_v1_webhooks_twilio_whatsapp_post","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/v1/auth/jwt/login":{"post":{"tags":["auth"],"summary":"Auth:Jwt.Login","operationId":"auth_jwt_login_api_v1_auth_jwt_login_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/x-www-form-urlencoded":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Body_auth_jwt_login_api_v1_auth_jwt_login_post"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/BearerResponse"},"example":{"access_token":"eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoiOTIyMWZmYzktNjQwZi00MzcyLTg2ZDMtY2U2NDJjYmE1NjAzIiwiYXVkIjoiZmFzdGFwaS11c2VyczphdXRoIiwiZXhwIjoxNTcxNTA0MTkzfQ.M10bjOe45I5Ncu_uXvOmVV8QxnL-nZfcH96U90JaocI","token_type":"bearer"}}}},"400":{"description":"Bad Request","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorModel"},"examples":{"LOGIN_BAD_CREDENTIALS":{"summary":"Bad credentials or the user is inactive.","value":{"detail":"LOGIN_BAD_CREDENTIALS"}},"LOGIN_USER_NOT_VERIFIED":{"summary":"The user is not verified.","value":{"detail":"LOGIN_USER_NOT_VERIFIED"}}}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/auth/jwt/logout":{"post":{"tags":["auth"],"summary":"Auth:Jwt.Logout","operationId":"auth_jwt_logout_api_v1_auth_jwt_logout_post","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing token or inactive user."}},"security":[{"OAuth2PasswordBearer":[]}]}},"/api/v1/auth/register":{"post":{"tags":["auth"],"summary":"Register:Register","operationId":"register_register_api_v1_auth_register_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UserCreate"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UserRead"}}}},"400":{"description":"Bad Request","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorModel"},"examples":{"REGISTER_USER_ALREADY_EXISTS":{"summary":"A user with this email already exists.","value":{"detail":"REGISTER_USER_ALREADY_EXISTS"}},"REGISTER_INVALID_PASSWORD":{"summary":"Password validation failed.","value":{"detail":{"code":"REGISTER_INVALID_PASSWORD","reason":"Password should beat least 3 characters"}}}}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/auth/me":{"get":{"tags":["auth"],"summary":"Get Me","operationId":"get_me_api_v1_auth_me_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UserRead"}}}}},"security":[{"OAuth2PasswordBearer":[]}]}},"/api/v1/dashboard/metrics":{"get":{"tags":["dashboard"],"summary":"Get Dashboard Metrics","description":"Fetches key metrics for the dashboard, isolated by tenant.","operationId":"get_dashboard_metrics_api_v1_dashboard_metrics_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}},"security":[{"OAuth2PasswordBearer":[]}]}},"/api/v1/dashboard/recommendations":{"get":{"tags":["dashboard"],"summary":"Get Dashboard Recommendations","description":"Fetches the latest staffing recommendations for the dashboard.","operationId":"get_dashboard_recommendations_api_v1_dashboard_recommendations_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}},"security":[{"OAuth2PasswordBearer":[]}]}},"/api/v1/reports/weekly":{"get":{"tags":["insights"],"summary":"Get Weekly Audit","description":"Triggers the \"Friday Audit\" weekly performance report.\nDefaults to the start of the current week (Monday).","operationId":"get_weekly_audit_api_v1_reports_weekly_get","parameters":[{"name":"tenant_id","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Tenant Id"},"example":"pilot_hotel"},{"name":"week_start","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"date","title":"Week Start"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/anomalies/scan":{"post":{"tags":["anomalies"],"summary":"Trigger an immediate anomaly scan for the current user's property","description":"Immediately queue an anomaly detection scan for the authenticated user.\n\nReturns 202 Accepted; the scan runs asynchronously as a BackgroundTask.","operationId":"trigger_anomaly_scan_api_v1_anomalies_scan_post","responses":{"202":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AnomalyScanResponse"}}}}},"security":[{"OAuth2PasswordBearer":[]}]}},"/api/v1/anomalies":{"get":{"tags":["anomalies"],"summary":"List anomalies for the current user's property","description":"Return a paginated list of anomalies ordered by window_start descending.","operationId":"list_anomalies_api_v1_anomalies_get","security":[{"OAuth2PasswordBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"page","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"Page number (1-indexed)","default":1,"title":"Page"},"description":"Page number (1-indexed)"},{"name":"page_size","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":100,"minimum":1,"description":"Items per page","default":20,"title":"Page Size"},"description":"Items per page"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AnomalyListResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/anomalies/roi":{"post":{"tags":["anomalies"],"summary":"Trigger ROI calculation for all detected anomalies (manual trigger)","description":"Immediately queue a full ROI calculation pass as a BackgroundTask.\n\nReturns 202 Accepted; the ROI calculation runs asynchronously.\nThe service iterates all anomalies with status='detected', computes ROI\nmetrics, and updates status to 'roi_positive' where net_roi > 0.\n\nAC 10: Manual trigger endpoint.","operationId":"trigger_roi_calculation_api_v1_anomalies_roi_post","responses":{"202":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ROICalculationResponse"}}}}},"security":[{"OAuth2PasswordBearer":[]}]}},"/api/v1/anomalies/format":{"post":{"tags":["anomalies"],"summary":"Trigger recommendation formatting for all roi_positive anomalies","description":"Manually trigger the recommendation formatter (AC #7).\n\n* If ``propertyId`` is provided in the request body, only that property\n  is processed.\n* Otherwise the formatter runs across all tenants / properties.\n\nReturns **202 Accepted** immediately.  Work runs as a BackgroundTask.\n\nIdempotency: re-running does not duplicate recommendations — the\nUNIQUE(anomaly_id) constraint handles this at the DB level (AC #8).","operationId":"trigger_format_api_v1_anomalies_format_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/FormatTriggerRequest"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Body"}}}},"responses":{"202":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/FormatTriggerResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"security":[{"OAuth2PasswordBearer":[]}]}},"/api/v1/notifications/test":{"post":{"tags":["notifications"],"summary":"Send a test notification","description":"Dispatches a single test message via the requested channel (sms, whatsapp, or email). Returns the provider message ID on success.","operationId":"send_test_notification_api_v1_notifications_test_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TestNotificationRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TestNotificationResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/notifications/dispatch":{"post":{"tags":["notifications"],"summary":"Manually trigger the alert dispatch pipeline","description":"Enqueues an immediate dispatch run for all ready_to_push staffing recommendations. Returns 202 immediately; the actual dispatch runs in the background. Useful for testing and on-demand delivery (Story 4.2).","operationId":"trigger_dispatch_api_v1_notifications_dispatch_post","responses":{"202":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object","title":"Response Trigger Dispatch Api V1 Notifications Dispatch Post"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/weather/sync":{"post":{"tags":["weather"],"summary":"Trigger weather forecast sync for a property","description":"Trigger a weather forecast ingestion for the authenticated user's property.\n\nReturns **202 Accepted** immediately.  The actual HTTP call to Open-Meteo\nand database upsert run asynchronously via BackgroundTasks so the caller\nis never blocked.\n\nIf `propertyId` is omitted in the body, the user's default property is used.","operationId":"trigger_weather_sync_api_v1_weather_sync_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WeatherSyncRequest","default":{}}}}},"responses":{"202":{"description":"Sync accepted and running in background","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WeatherSyncResponse"}}}},"404":{"description":"No property linked to this user"},"422":{"description":"Property has no GPS coordinates configured"}},"security":[{"OAuth2PasswordBearer":[]}]}},"/api/v1/baselines/{tenant_id}":{"get":{"tags":["baselines"],"summary":"Get Baseline","description":"Return the stored captation baseline for *tenant_id*.","operationId":"get_baseline_api_v1_baselines__tenant_id__get","security":[{"OAuth2PasswordBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"tenant_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Tenant Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/baselines/{tenant_id}/recalculate":{"post":{"tags":["baselines"],"summary":"Recalculate Baseline","description":"(Re)calculate the captation baseline from all historical PMS sync data.","operationId":"recalculate_baseline_api_v1_baselines__tenant_id__recalculate_post","security":[{"OAuth2PasswordBearer":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"tenant_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Tenant Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/events/sync":{"post":{"tags":["events"],"summary":"Trigger PredictHQ event sync for the current tenant","description":"Enqueues a background PredictHQ event ingestion job for the authenticated\nuser's property.\n\nReturns **202 Accepted** immediately; ingestion runs asynchronously.\nEvents within ``radius_km`` of the property GPS (default 5 km) and\nstarting within the next ``days_ahead`` days (default 30) are fetched.","operationId":"trigger_event_sync_api_v1_events_sync_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/EventSyncRequest","default":{"radiusKm":5.0,"daysAhead":30}}}}},"responses":{"202":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/EventSyncResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"security":[{"OAuth2PasswordBearer":[]}]}},"/api/v1/roi/simulate":{"post":{"tags":["roi"],"summary":"Simulate Aetherix ROI for a prospective property (public, stateless)","description":"Return an order-of-magnitude savings projection grounded in P0-2 backtest KPIs.\n\nNotes:\n- All figures are **simulated** — based on synthetic-data backtest and public\n  hospitality benchmarks (ADEME, Accor sustainability reports). No live pilot.\n- Low/high bounds reflect +/- reasonable ranges around central assumptions.\n- Use this to size the opportunity, not to commit to a contract number.","operationId":"simulate_roi_api_v1_roi_simulate_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ROISimulateRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ROISimulateResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"x-agent-callable":true,"x-mcp-compatible":true}},"/mcp/v0/":{"post":{"tags":["mcp"],"summary":"MCP JSON-RPC endpoint (initialize, tools/list, tools/call)","operationId":"mcp_rpc_mcp_v0__post","parameters":[{"name":"authorization","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Authorization"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true,"title":"Response Mcp Rpc Mcp V0  Post"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"x-agent-callable":true,"x-mcp-compatible":true}},"/api/v1/demo/stream":{"get":{"tags":["demo"],"summary":"SSE stream for demo_board.html","description":"Subscribe to pipeline stage events via Server-Sent Events.\n\nReturns HTTP 503 when ``DEMO_MODE=false``.\n\nEach event is a plain ``data:`` line::\n\n    data: mcp_probe\\n\\n\n    data: mcp_probe_done\\n\\n\n    data: pms_sync\\n\\n\n    ...\n\nThe demo_board.html EventSource listener calls ``highlight(stage, state)``\non each received event.","operationId":"demo_stream_api_v1_demo_stream_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/webhooks/twilio/inbound":{"post":{"tags":["webhooks"],"summary":"Twilio Inbound Webhook","description":"Receive an inbound SMS/WhatsApp message and route it appropriately.\n\nStory 4.3 (HOS-26) — Accept / Reject path:\nAC#1  — Parses \"Accept\" / \"Reject\" (case-insensitive).\nAC#2  — Updates StaffingRecommendation status: accepted | rejected.\nAC#3  — Sets actioned_at timestamp.\nAC#4  — Returns help TwiML for unrecognised input (no error raised).\nAC#5  — Async DB path ensures < 200 ms response time under normal load.\nAC#6  — Returns TwiML XML; Content-Type: application/xml.\nAC#7  — No get_current_user dependency (public Twilio callback).\nAC#8  — Signature check skipped when TWILIO_SKIP_SIGNATURE_VALIDATION=true.\n\nStory 5.1 (HOS-28) — Conversational query path (FR13):\nAC#1  — Non-action text kicks off a BackgroundTask.\nAC#2  — BackgroundTask resolves tenant_id + recommendation from phone number.\nAC#3  — Webhook immediately returns a TwiML acknowledgement (< 50 ms).\nAC#4  — Query persisted in conversational_queries table.\nAC#5  — No matching recommendation → polite TwiML response.\nAC#6  — Idempotency: duplicate within 60 s is suppressed.","operationId":"twilio_inbound_webhook_webhooks_twilio_inbound_post","parameters":[{"name":"x-twilio-signature","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"X-Twilio-Signature"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/x-www-form-urlencoded":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Body_twilio_inbound_webhook_webhooks_twilio_inbound_post"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/.well-known/agent.json":{"get":{"tags":["agent-seo"],"summary":"Agent discovery manifest","description":"Return the Aetherix agent discovery manifest.\n\nThis endpoint is public (no auth) and is intended to be crawled by\nthird-party agents and orchestrators discovering Aetherix capabilities.","operationId":"agent_manifest__well_known_agent_json_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Machine-readable agent capability manifest","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/health":{"get":{"tags":["ops"],"summary":"Health Check","description":"Returns 200 OK when the service is up.","operationId":"health_check_health_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}}},"components":{"schemas":{"AnomalyListResponse":{"properties":{"items":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DemandAnomalyRead"},"type":"array","title":"Items"},"total":{"type":"integer","title":"Total"},"page":{"type":"integer","title":"Page"},"pageSize":{"type":"integer","title":"Pagesize"}},"type":"object","required":["items","total","page","pageSize"],"title":"AnomalyListResponse","description":"Paginated wrapper for GET /api/v1/anomalies."},"AnomalyScanResponse":{"properties":{"message":{"type":"string","title":"Message","default":"Anomaly scan triggered"},"propertyId":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Propertyid"}